<section class="sec" id="overview">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="rv"><p class="plate">Overview</p><h2 class="h2 mt-s">How this division works.</h2>
      <div class="mt-m"><p class="body-copy">We develop property we would be willing to hold. That single discipline drives every decision upstream: how we underwrite a site, how much we spend on structure and services versus finish, and which locations we decline.</p><p class="body-copy">The division runs the full cycle — acquisition and title verification, feasibility and design management, construction delivery, then handover into asset management or sale. Industrial and logistics property is a growing share of the pipeline as manufacturing and retailing demand shifts.</p></div></div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1"><p class="plate">Specification</p><div class="spec"><div class="spec__r"><div class="spec__k">Asset classes</div><div class="spec__v">Residential, commercial office and retail, industrial and logistics</div></div><div class="spec__r"><div class="spec__k">Scope</div><div class="spec__v">Acquisition, feasibility, design management, delivery, asset management</div></div><div class="spec__r"><div class="spec__k">Markets</div><div class="spec__v">Lagos primary; selected South-West and Abuja corridor opportunities</div></div><div class="spec__r"><div class="spec__k">Delivery model</div><div class="spec__v">Direct development and structured joint ventures with landowners</div></div><div class="spec__r"><div class="spec__k">Title</div><div class="spec__v">Full verification and perfection before commitment</div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

