wBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M4 21V8l7-4 7 4v13M9 21v-6h6v6M9 11h.01M14 11h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Joint venture structuring</h3><p>Landowner partnership models where land is contributed against development equity.</p></article></div>
