<section class="sec tint" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:900px">
    <div class="sec-head rv"><p class="plate">Questions</p><h2 class="h2 mt-s">Answered plainly.</h2></div>
    <div class="acc"><div class="acc__i"><button class="acc__b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="real-estate-0"><span>Do you sell units or hold them?</span><span class="acc__ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc__p" id="real-estate-0"><div>Both, depending on the asset. Residential schemes are typically brought to market; industrial and selected commercial assets are more often held and operated for yield.</div></div></div><div class="acc__i"><button class="acc__b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="real-estate-1"><span>Will you partner with landowners?</span><span class="acc__ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc__p" id="real-estate-1"><div>Yes. Joint ventures where land is contributed against development equity are a core part of the pipeline. Terms depend on title status, location and scheme viability.</div></div></div><div class="acc__i"><button class="acc__b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="real-estate-2"><span>How is title handled?</span><span class="acc__ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc__p" id="real-estate-2"><div>Verification and perfection are completed before we commit capital or announce a scheme. We do not develop on unresolved title.</div></div></div><div class="acc__i"><button class="acc__b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="real-estate-3"><span>Can you deliver on a site we already own?</span><span class="acc__ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc__p" id="real-estate-3"><div>Yes — as a development manager or under a joint venture. We will run feasibility first and tell you plainly if the numbers do not support the scheme.</div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

